 "text": "Press Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window D3 Meet Us Services Our Work Blog Careers Contact Us REQUEST A QUOTE ID3AS Blog How an AI Assistant Can Turn Website Visitors into Leads May 20, 2026 READ MORE When It’s Time to Redesign Your Website Five Reasons Pay-Per-Click Ads Generate Business Retargeting 101: How to Remarket Your Brand Google Ads or Meta? Here’s What We Tell Clients Are You Writing for AI, or Letting AI Write for You? SEO & Social: When Worlds Collide READ MORE Smarter Marketing For AI: Strategies That Work June 10, 2026 AI is changing how customers find businesses. Instead of scrolling search results, people are asking questions and expecting direct answers. “What can we do right now to make our business show up as an answer in AI?” That was one of the most asked questions during D3’s AI Series. As a digital marketing company experiencing... READ MORE How an AI Assistant Can Turn Website Visitors into Leads May 20, 2026 Imagine being able to guide every visitor through your website, especially those who don’t know exactly what they want or how to find it. A custom AI Assistant can help to bridge that gap and retain your visitors. This tool quickly answers questions, provides an overview of your services, and helps to convert those visitors... READ MORE When It’s Time to Redesign Your Website February 25, 2026 “How do I know when it is time to redesign my website?” is one of the most common questions we hear from business owners. An outdated website can cost you visibility, trust, and leads. Having been in the digital marketing business for 30 years, D3 knows one thing for certain: evolution is expected. Your customers... READ MORE Five Reasons Pay-Per-Click Ads Generate Business December 1, 2025 Wondering if pay-per-click advertising still matters as the world dives deeper into AI, ChatGPT, and other Answer Engines? According to DemandSage, businesses make an average of $2 in revenue for every $1 spent on Google Ads, and 63% of consumers click on paid digital ads when they intend to buy a product online. Pay-Per-Click (PPC)... READ MORE Retargeting 101: How to Remarket Your Brand October 13, 2025 In today’s competitive, crowded, and privacy-first digital environment, retargeting is essential in helping your brand reconnect with users who have already shown interest. It’s one of the most powerful ways to reconnect with visitors to your site and make the most out of every marketing dollar. The truth is, most people will not convert the... READ MORE Google Ads or Meta? Here’s What We Tell Clients September 26, 2025 Are you ready to take your advertising to the next level, but are unsure of where to begin? When D3 meets with business owners and decision makers, one of the first questions that comes up is, “Should we run Google or Meta/Facebook ads?” And the answer isn’t always as simple as you’d think. The two... ID3AS Blog Stay up to date with the latest marketing tips, tricks, and trends from the experts at D3. Ready to brush up on something new to take your business to new heights? Check here for insight, inspiration, and most importantly – ID3AS! Subscribe Get the latest marketing news and advice. First Name Last Name Email SUBSCRIBE This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. 1 2 3 … 9 » Subscribe Get the latest marketing news and advice. First Name Last Name Email SUBSCRIBE This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. 12319 Ocean Gateway, Suite 202 Ocean City, Maryland 21842 410-213-2400 212 West Main Street Salisbury, Maryland 21801 Meet Us Testimonials Services Case Studies Videos ID3AS Blog Careers Contact Us Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Webmail Accessibility Site Map Copyright © 2026 D3. All Rights Reserved. Website Design by D3, Ocean City MD Our Partners PREVIOUS Google YouTube Shopify Amazon Adobe Woocomm